# Planning Templates: {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Templates for planning and documenting features.

## Available Templates

| Template | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `plan.md` | Feature planning |
| `results.md` | Results documentation |

## Usage

1. Copy template to `.claude/plans/` with feature name
2. Fill in all sections
3. Get approval before implementation
4. After completion, move to `.claude/results/` with actual outcomes

## Workflow

```
1. Create plan from template
2. Review and approve plan
3. Implement with CDD (contracts first, then code + tests)
4. Document results
5. Run analysis (@dev-analyst)
6. Extract learnings
```
